diff --git a/docs/backup.md b/docs/backup.md
index 84ae951..7e888e3 100644
--- a/docs/backup.md
+++ b/docs/backup.md
@@ -81,6 +81,10 @@ Example: `moco/foo/bar/20210515-230003/dump.tar`
 
 This allows multiple MySQLClusters to share the same bucket.
 
+`moco` is the default.  With `jobConfig.bucketConfig.prefix`, the keys start with that prefix instead,
+e.g. `backups/foo/bar/20210515-230003/dump.tar` with `prefix: backups`.
+A restore reads the backups under the prefix in its own `jobConfig.bucketConfig`.
+
 ### Timestamps
 
 Internally, the time for PiTR is formatted in UTC timezone.
